1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:03,954
Table for one. Again.

2
00:00:03,994 --> 00:00:07,842
Nobody eats alone
on Thanksgiving!

3
00:00:08,362 --> 00:00:13,220
Microwave fee: five dollars!
Gratitude: three ninety-nine!

4
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,401
Gratitude should be free!

5
00:00:15,441 --> 00:00:17,538
Nothing is free.

6
00:00:20,658 --> 00:00:23,191
Evening, Rae!
The usual!

7
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:26,217
Rule nine:
always cover it.

8
00:00:27,637 --> 00:00:30,583
Okay! What's everyone
thankful for?

9
00:00:30,623 --> 00:00:31,954
...Company.

10
00:00:31,994 --> 00:00:33,560
Paying customers!

11
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,506
Rae? Join us!

12
00:00:35,546 --> 00:00:37,408
I don't do holidays.

13
00:00:38,578 --> 00:00:40,597
...Pass the gravy.
